   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AmazonMWAA API (2020-07-01). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Environments are configuration metadata and stay CREATING: no Airflow scheduler, worker, web server, VPC endpoint or log group is provisioned, and DAG, plugin, requirement and startup-script paths in S3 are not read. CreateCliToken, CreateWebLoginToken, InvokeRestApi and PublishMetrics return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501; no WebserverUrl or service-linked role is assigned. UpdateEnvironment cannot change NetworkConfiguration or WorkerReplacementStrategy. SDK clients must disable host-prefix injection (botocore inject_host_prefix=False) because the official api. host prefix cannot address the loopback endpoint.",
